@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Booking Request Widget for Guesthouses"; ViewData["Description"] = "Add a booking request widget to your guesthouse or holiday rental website. Review dates, manage named rooms and confirm each reservation yourself."; }
<div class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">FOR SMALL PLACES WITH A PERSONAL WELCOME</p><h1>Your website.<br/>A simpler way to request a stay.</h1><p>Receive direct reservation requests, review the dates and confirm each stay yourself. Built for one property and individually named rooms or apartments.</p><a class="button" href="/Owner">Set up your property</a></div><section class="card"><h2>You stay in control</h2><p>A request does not hold dates. Confirmation checks this system's inventory before creating a reservation.</p><p>Confirmation emails can be enabled; external calendar sync remains manual. Check your dashboard daily and record outside bookings before agreeing a stay.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Add a booking request widget to your website</h2><p>Add an isolated widget to your existing website, manage a simple calendar and confirm each stay after agreeing the terms directly. No website replacement, large hotel inventory model or payment setup.</p><nav aria-label="Explore StayWidget"><a href="/Demo">Try the booking request demo</a><a href="/Pricing">Compare plans</a><a href="/Install">Read the booking widget installation guide</a><a href="/Limitations">Read the limitations</a></nav><p>Hosted preview. Free early-access Pro is the default; no card or automatic charges.</p></section>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="guesthouse-guide-heading"><h2 id="guesthouse-guide-heading">A booking request workflow for a small guesthouse</h2><p>For a guesthouse with two named rooms, add each room in the owner dashboard, record unavailable dates and approve the exact website origin where the widget will appear. Follow the <a href="/Install">website embedding guide</a>, then test the widget on your published page.</p><p>A guest requests a room and dates; the request does not reserve those dates. Review it in your dashboard, agree the stay terms directly and confirm only when availability is correct. Record bookings from other channels manually because external calendar synchronization is not included. Guest confirmation email depends on configured delivery, so check your dashboard daily.</p><p>Read the <a href="/Limitations">booking availability and notification limitations</a> before accepting real requests.</p></section>
